  <plot>**[East Blue Saga]**

After his humiliating defeat at the hands of Luffy, Zoro and Nami back at Orange Town, Buggy begins his quest to flashily regain his body parts and his crew, and then find a way to get his flashy revenge on Luffy. Along the way, he will fight dastardly foes and meet unexpected allies. All the while, the Buggy Pirates mourn the loss of their flashy leader, which raises the question... if Buggy's gone, who would be second-in-command..?</plot>
